ln_tradevol   ln_gaci_cwm   gaci_cwmean   unesco_cum    lnz_own       lnland        deg_sum       eig_mean      betw_sum      regimp_mean   tour_shift    merch_inte~y  ln_remote     cult_e        z_cult

